OL,3,AEngland's mayors to be given power to
OL,4,Aintroduce tourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe levy will be charged as a
OL,7,Fpercentage of the cost of
OL,8,Faccommodation, rather than as a flat
OL,9,Ffee - a move the government argues will
OL,10,Fprotect budget holidays.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
