OL,3,ASpanish intelligence warned of Ceuta
OL,4,Amass crossing plans before surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpanish intelligence services warned of
OL,7,Fsocial media calls for a mass migrant
OL,8,Fcrossing into Ceuta the day before tens
OL,9,Fof thousands of people entered the
OL,10,Fterritory, newly released government
OL,11,Fdocuments show.
OL,13,FThe revelations emerged in documents
OL,14,Fdeclassified by the Spanish government
OL,15,Famid accusations it failed to give the
OL,16,Ffull story of the migrant influx.
OL,18,FOn 29 July, Spain's National
OL,19,FIntelligence Service (CNI) told
OL,20,FMoroccan and Ceuta authorities that
OL,21,Fsocial media groups were encouraging
OL,22,Fmigrants to cross the following day.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
